  "description": {
   "en": "When he woke up, he was in a room he didn't recognize. A little girl, Lulu, called him \"Big Brother.\"\n\n\"We're all here, I'll go get Dad!\" Then Lulu left the room with a bright smile. He didn't know where he was. And he didn't have a sister. In an instant, the door opened. Something came with a rattling sound.\n\nSomething called \"Dad\" entered the living room.\n\nA high concentration of mystery and fear is chained together in this crazy situational thriller. If you read this, you will be part of our \"family\" from today."
  },
